Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.47,0:00:04.94,Default,TV,0000,0000,0000,,Typhoon 13 is maintaining its very strong momentum, heading northwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.94,0:00:09.90,Default,TV,0000,0000,0000,,Minami Daitou has entered the circumference of the storm last night at 11pm. {http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minamidait%C5%8D,_Okinawa}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:13.36,Default,TV,0000,0000,0000,,At this stage, the effect on road traffic is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:17.33,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:21.04,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,The TV said the bullet train pooped!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:22.31,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:28.59,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not "poop", it's "operation". {Note: Kouki hears it as うんこ unko = faeces while Daikichi explains that it's うんこう unkou (運行)=Operation/Service}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:28.59,Note,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Note: Kouki hears it as うんこ unko = faeces, while Daikichi explains that it's うんこう unkou (運行)= Operation/Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:29.88,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Poop?{Unko?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.41,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Operation! {Unkou!}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.41,0:00:36.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's saying that the bullet train is operating as usual, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:38.35,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Which means it's still running like{as } usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:43.17,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Pooping as usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:52.69,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I have to poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:56.78,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:01:01.75,Default,TV,0000,0000,0000,,The path of Typhoon 13 is changing its course towards the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.75,0:01:06.14,Default,TV,0000,0000,0000,,It'll strike the eastern sea region approximately between dusk and nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.05,0:01:08.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,There's a typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:12.19,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There will be typhoons every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.19,0:01:14.22,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.41,0:01:17.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You ran out of paper? {Toilet paper}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:18.49,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,A really long one came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:20.18,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Get me a ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:23.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You did say boys are mischievous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.43,0:01:26.19,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(720,0)}Now I understand your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:14.69,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be coming to pick you up early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.69,0:03:15.75,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:18.05,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.09,0:03:21.82,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't I incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:25.68,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Bye~!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:39.98,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Look at the places where I circled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:42.92,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,It'll look really nice if you can space them out the same distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:43.78,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.78,0:03:46.88,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei! How much is suitable?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:48.19,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:50.00,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,How many centimetres? How many millimetres?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:04:01.51,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Please don't include the circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:04.01,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:07.51,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,All right, do the rest as homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:09.54,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,The next period is Life Lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:11.43,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,First year students will draw together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:14.38,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Assemble {at }in front of the Morning Glories you each planted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:15.60,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:17.60,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:31.13,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know sandbags were that heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:33.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's only morning and I'm dead beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:36.58,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,There were so many samples to get shipped only today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.53,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, arigatou.{Leave it.  PLEASE leave this as it.  He says "thank you" in English and we sub it as "arigatou."  Perfect.}{Hei Hei -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:48.01,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,My child's education insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.01,0:04:51.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? I thought your kid is still a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.30,0:04:54.44,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It won't work if I buy when they're older.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:56.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,T-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.78,0:04:59.14,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,We also bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:02.44,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,They probably won't make it to university, since they're {\i1}my{\i0}{\fscx25} {\fscx100} kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:04.39,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I have two at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.39,0:05:05.80,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,There's just too much to spend on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:09.72,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Mine are still young, but their childcare expenses are already a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:11.66,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Their clothes won't last too long, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:14.86,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we aren't full-time employees.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:17.67,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,But we still have welfare pensions and health insurance. {厚生年金 kouseinenkin = welfare pension; 健康保険 kenkouhoken = health insurance}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:19.13,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,That's a huge help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:21.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What about life insurance and the sorts? {生命保険 seimeihoken = Life Insurance}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:24.00,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,My wife is in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:26.51,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,A large sum will be given if I were to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:30.10,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,My wife has a Savings Bond, the most basic of all...{Maybe "My wife is <something>ing insurance, the most basic of all..." ? -sm}{A "bond" is another kind of insurance, specifically meant for savings, like for a kid for college.-AvidElite}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:35.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All of you are really fathers. It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:38.06,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Not amazing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Getting insured...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:42.36,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How much will I have to spend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:44.85,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,My neighbour's kid is too noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.85,0:05:47.17,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I want to move, but I don't have the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.17,0:05:51.28,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even know exactly why I work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.09,0:05:53.67,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You'd better watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:55.45,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,When you get married, you'll be just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:56.61,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.61,0:05:58.87,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even have a girlfriend; I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:06:02.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Even though they always keep complaining non-stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:07.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But basically, they give off a sense of security.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:13.26,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1210)}They're not like Rin's mother at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:34.08,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:36.79,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down, be good, and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:45.96,Default,Guys,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:52.18,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Where is your drawing board?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:53.76,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.76,0:06:55.89,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,The ground is flat, so I don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:58.19,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,That won't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:07:00.60,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have you go and retrieve it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:03.24,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Right this instant! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.47,0:07:10.74,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, Rin-chan's drawing, it's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:13.72,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,It's true, you're amazing. It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:15.05,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.05,0:07:17.83,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's drawn really well indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.51,0:07:22.96,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,The color of this flower and this one here is slightly different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:27.71,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-san's drawing also has blue and purple colored flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:31.42,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,You have sharp observation skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:40.85,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun and the rest are slacking off again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:50.97,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san, it's drawing lesson time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:55.20,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Your Morning Glory is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.86,0:07:58.93,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be such a waste if you don't properly sketch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.93,0:08:01.16,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like drawing, Kouki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:04.29,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm... it's OK, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.29,0:08:09.27,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Tatsumi-sensei, I'm that boy's homeroom teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.27,0:08:13.09,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Why does Kouki-san always bother everyone?{Why is Kouki-san always disturbing others? }{Actually, she's asking Kouki why he disturbs others. Please change if needed. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:15.09,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Quickly sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.09,0:08:16.92,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give strange faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:32.99,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's cap belongs to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:34.52,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:39.14,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kouki-san and you two!{I know she said -tachi, but there's no easy way to write that.}{Yeah. Like, as if "Hey, Kouki-sans" is being said lol -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.14,0:08:40.38,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:41.20,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:43.66,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Over here, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:49.85,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:57.39,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun! Sit down and draw properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:58.55,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Just ignore them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:06.23,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:08.23,Default,Boys,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:20.64,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,That's incredible, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:23.98,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun is always doing weird stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:25.50,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,He's really scary when he gets angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:28.42,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, will you be bullied by him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:30.02,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:32.86,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I already know him from when we were in daycare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.86,0:09:35.28,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:53.58,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Still not here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:02.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All of you pick your kids up at 6pm, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.27,0:10:04.57,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, looks like it'll be hard today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.57,0:10:06.91,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's here!{coming! }
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:12.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Let's finish it all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.20,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Right on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.94,0:10:23.35,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.35,0:10:25.99,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're totally drenched.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.99,0:10:29.27,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Your father is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:31.45,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.45,0:10:33.77,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:35.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.77,0:10:38.28,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:41.45,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,The wind is getting strong, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:45.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It would have been better if I got here sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:46.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is she the last person?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:48.75,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,There's still Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:50.46,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:52.46,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's a storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.46,0:10:54.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's pretty incredible outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:07.97,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:11.44,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, the umbrella is flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:13.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:14.40,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.15,0:11:21.16,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:23.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:42.18,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.18,0:11:46.35,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.05,0:11:52.14,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, it's against the rules, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:53.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.27,0:11:56.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But the wind is going to keep getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:59.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll contact Nitani-san to see if she minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.81,0:12:03.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Can I hand over the phone after that, so you can verify for yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:07.06,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,If that's the case...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:09.34,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,Both of us can leave early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:10.72,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,What's that!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:14.12,Default,Puffy,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:36.69,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:37.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:39.69,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:49.70,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.41,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Get behind me and follow closely!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:01.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:03.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get the towels now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:05.97,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Storm shutters, the storm shutters. {雨戸 amado = sliding storm shutter}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:20.82,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:21.98,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let me try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.39,0:13:26.95,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here, don't get your fingers stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:35.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:49.34,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It feels just like a secret base.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:54.43,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! It's entering my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:57.69,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm washing it, so don't open your eyes. {Joined. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.98,0:14:04.42,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,OK. Dry the rest off yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:11.87,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, your back is so wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:17.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:22.46,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening! It's Nitani!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:25.21,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.16,0:14:30.97,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't expect you to get here so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:34.06,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like I did you a favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:37.52,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It's really unexpected; you were a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:40.69,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry{Sorry about that}; Kouki also got drenched.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:45.19,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really in {at }your care for many things, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:55.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It really suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.61,0:15:00.27,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Lend me yours, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:01.21,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,You're at it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.21,0:15:02.59,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It should be Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.59,0:15:04.75,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi said he's fine with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:07.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. I feel more comfortable this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:11.31,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! Daikichi is Daikichi, and it's fine like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:12.93,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:21.86,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,You're really skilled, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:23.97,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I also know how to use a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.97,0:15:26.64,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I see, you're already a big sister now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:28.59,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But I still have to ask Daikichi when using the stove.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:30.07,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I want to try too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:34.77,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you never help with cooking meals?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.77,0:15:36.50,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I want to cut too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:39.15,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can lend you my knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:46.34,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no! The onions are terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:48.07,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:50.01,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry and wash your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:53.73,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It feels terrible; I want to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:52.18,Default-Alt,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.07,0:16:02.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is that... hamburger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:03.34,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:06.34,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It looks good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:09.28,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It looks kind of strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.28,0:16:11.25,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's not strange at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:12.39,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:15.70,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it shouldn't taste too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:19.16,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! The eggs are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:20.70,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Can you crack them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:22.83,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:29.56,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:30.84,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's done really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.57,0:16:34.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, that kid, is actually pretty happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.90,0:16:40.39,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, do you like your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:47.19,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so, though she's just a naggy old hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:56.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's also a genuine sense of security right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:01.75,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This one's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:03.97,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Where's your "Itadakimasu"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:09.21,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Itadakimasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:11.38,Default,All,0000,0000,0000,,Itadakimasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:26.79,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, use your chopsticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:28.69,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm just gathering them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.89,0:17:36.17,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:42.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:44.35,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:47.21,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It's delicious when everyone eats together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:49.75,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat here again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:51.12,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.19,0:18:03.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be all right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:04.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Leave the rest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:06.21,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:13.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,After that, it went smack on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:17.58,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,He's having so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:21.17,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't been able to give him this kind of opportunity until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:24.04,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really happy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:25.72,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.08,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's no need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:28.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I should be the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:32.59,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The teacher said not to include the circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.59,0:18:34.88,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,To be able to see that kind of expression from him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.88,0:18:38.17,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,leaving early wasn't a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.96,0:18:42.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She also raising a child on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:44.51,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:46.41,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Come here for a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:48.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:57.23,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's about time we got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.23,0:18:58.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Shall I call a taxi?{Do you need a taxi?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:01.53,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.01,0:19:05.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, why don't you just stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:08.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.40,0:19:10.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't Reina-chan and her mom also stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.84,0:19:13.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's totally different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.88,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:19.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:20.63,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye~!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:23.46,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.46,0:19:25.60,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really thankful for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:28.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We also had a lot of fun.{\alpha&FFFFFF&} Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:29.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We also had a lot of fun. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:30.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:18.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye~!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.30,0:22:10.49,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The typhoon is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.49,0:22:11.93,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:14.59,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin~ chan~!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.86,0:22:17.94,Default-Alt,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin~ chan~!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:17.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun is here so early?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:20.06,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He's really early.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.22,0:22:23.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.12,0:22:25.21,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.44,0:22:28.07,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.99,0:22:36.20,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I even wanted to open the storm shutters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.13,0:22:45.31,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The sky is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.31,0:22:47.31,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.92,0:22:49.63,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, we're going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.71,0:22:51.97,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:35.95,Credits,,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(291,168)}Oyatsu Fansubs Presents
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:35.95,Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs90\pos(855,397)\blur1\fnFranklin Gothic Heavy}Usagi\NDrop
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:28.01,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fax-0.09\frz346.094\blur0.7\fs28\pos(492,174)\c&H93A6AD&\fnTekton Pro}Kaga Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:28.01,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fay0.005\an7\fax-0.02\blur0.8\fnTekton Pro\b0\fs28\c&HA5B6BC&\frz345.033\frx356\fry2\pos(692,159)}The meat-potato Daikichi\Nmakes are delicious, and\Nhe can run very fast too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:28.01,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fax-0.13\b0\blur0.7\fnTekton Pro\frz348.492\pos(393,432)\c&H44575C&}Daikichi
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:39.06,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k9}{\k13}a{\k52}shi{\k45}ta {\k18}no {\k22}ko{\k25}to {\k21}ha {\k20}{\k20}wa{\k29}ka{\k17}n{\k9}na{\k10}i
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:39.06,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k11}{\k65}明{\k45}日{\k18}の{\k22}こ{\k25}と{\k21}は{\k20}{\k20}わ{\k29}か{\k17}ん{\k9}な{\k10}い。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:39.06,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know what's going to happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.06,0:01:44.19,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k22}{\k22}ko{\k55}re{\k32}tte {\k14}gi{\k48}se{\k19}i {\k21}to{\k41}ha {\k31}chi{\k23}ga{\k19}u.{\k18} {\k24}na{\k18}ni{\k24}ka {\k18}ga {\k25}chi{\k19}ga{\k22}u.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.06,0:01:44.19,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k22}{\k22}こ{\k55}れ{\k32}って{\k14}ギ{\k48}セ{\k19}イ{\k21}と{\k41}は{\k54}違{\k19}う。{\k18}{\k42}何{\k24}か{\k18}が{\k44}違{\k22}う。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.06,0:01:44.19,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,This is different from sacrificing. Very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.19,0:01:47.91,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k24}{\k19}ba{\k26}tsu{\k22}ge{\k23}e{\k21}mu {\k20}ja{\k18}n, {\k27}na{\k17}n{\k13}te {\k10}o{\k27}mo{\k35}wa{\k45}na{\k23}i.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.19,0:01:47.91,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k24}{\k45}罰{\k22}ゲ{\k23}ー{\k21}ム{\k20}じゃ{\k18}ん、{\k27}な{\k17}ん{\k13}て{\k37}思{\k35}わ{\k45}な{\k23}い。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.19,0:01:47.91,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think this is a punishment game either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:51.08,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k17}{\k21}de, {\k24}na{\k21}n{\k41}de {\k22}na{\k21}no{\k24}ka {\k22}wa{\k37}{\k32}ka{\k13}n{\k24}nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:51.08,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k17}{\k21}で、{\k24}な{\k21}ん{\k41}で{\k22}な{\k21}の{\k24}か{\k22}わ{\k37}{\k32}か{\k13}ん{\k12}な{\k12}い。
